{"summary":"Try this game inspired by a pen-and-paper classic!","description":"Grids of Thermometers delivers the relaxed fun of a pen-and-paper logic game right to your fingertips. In each level, you fill a grid of thermometers with mercury. Numbers on the grid edges tell you how many cells must be filled in each row and column.\nNo random guessing! Solve the levels with logic only.\n\nFEATURES:\nThousands of levels\nExclusive new levels every day\nNo rush: play at your own pace by starting a level and completing it later\nNo Wi-Fi? Enjoy playing offline\nMultiple grid sizes for varied difficulty\nAbility to zoom in and move the grid on smaller devices\n\nFollow us to get news and updates:\nfacebook.com/frozax\ntwitter.com/frozax\nwww.frozax.com","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $5.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QkbNjaH5_Bs?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F23fBsKxwxkytX-B-_0072Nqmeovh9b39rC0-oW_L9iOPtwWrIzyeNqHBMLSC2BZGD29WNra41OZX-tobYTCzg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AEO8jst81v7BL0LQWTJieOT2ZCDVxkJELkeeylInnuVRp5vsJyssv2ziHGGN4AVMReNxGj2zxXc5cQuUZwSemA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KyurxWJrdbUbST1X31TUvS_lD9siS61PrzDH6r5AQAQ3DrWR4dnEX1yzS5-wRCrhOIMDJtkaq1tMpVxZgcNL9w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0N10SVXCfeggfsyGm6RXIX9JrO8vFlFov41xw6ex6O2YDwnsQFtREhj-dTXVWLn_d0pDxVJTxUNHWYBMXB89","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F4lbOwqaJjow_t6o2D5KBROOQ-TCejLBuljn0vKDyegtYew8T7GvqVuwUNEktwF6u65W93EKr3UMSBqlYrPNZw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wDhyTn5PU3jPpLVnYE-Rp5kZ9WF0hMMsdgNnJ3INBzoSPKvtuzCx3AXfk_LntS5SlDjUW5Jljx-HkimqgHr_","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DAkHg1kEAVWhaOzTFEmc3N0XXAqQUAfM2c9kN5XOyZGdX3oItOd4sH9Q0iiiiuQNsQphPTSYi56bF97h9XXz","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XEzv1AEYB3mxEoDzeSzByDwoNb1ShxKC3eCO3xIIi0cjGZQRYzdvNafVVpv-ck1qb2vemg7clgvG5rWPQsliJw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XhhbibA2W